  Sorry, this one fails to say what you want.  You were taken in by
"raumei", which is a cmavo cluster meaning a suffiency
(sufficient-cardinality), as a llujvo.  But if  you  add "tol" to the front
of it. you now ARE making it a lujvo that means "the opposite of a
gradation-some".  (rau is the rafsi of gradu)  Whatever THAT means.... (you
could use to'e, of coure, but that throws off the syllable count)

